OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuse survivor wins Make
OL,4,Aa Difference Award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA domestic abuse survivor has won the
OL,7,FBBC Radio Jersey Make a Difference
OL,8,FAward for her work to help bring change
OL,9,Fto the law in the island to help
OL,10,Fothers.
OL,12,FSuzie Mahe waived her right to lifetime
OL,13,Fanonymity in 2024 when her abuser was
OL,14,Fjailed for assaulting and raping her.
OL,16,FFriends and fellow women's rights
OL,17,Fcampaigners have called her
OL,18,F"inspirational" and someone who has
OL,19,Fbeen "pivotal" in bringing changes to
OL,20,Fthe legal system in the island.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
