OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuse survivor wins Make
OL,4,Aa Difference Award
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs she was given the award, Mahe said
OL,7,F"I am shaking" and added: "I didn't
OL,8,Fexpect anything... It just surprises me
OL,9,Fhow many people care and how many
OL,10,Fpeople it's touched."
